android/ - provenance and changes
=================================

This Android shell was generated from the Solana Mobile **webshell** CLI
template, then modified. The upstream template is the starting point for the
files listed as "derived" below; the rest of this directory is Vanta's.

  Generator  @solana-mobile/webshell-cli 0.1.0
  Upstream   https://github.com/solana-mobile/web-shell (directory `template/`)
  License    none declared upstream

The upstream repository declares `"license": null` in its package.json and ships
no LICENSE, COPYING or NOTICE file. It is not Apache-2.0 and this file does not
claim that it is. The full statement, and why Vanta still treats the generated
shell as its own work, is in the repository root `NOTICE`, section 3. Vanta
asserts no rights over any upstream template code, and will follow any license
Solana Mobile publishes for the template.

Vanta's own code in this repository, including its changes to this directory, is
Apache-2.0. See `../LICENSE`.


Derived from the upstream template
----------------------------------

  app/build.gradle.kts             signed-release block, the WEB_SHELL_* Gradle
